  "description": "*********Please make an application at https://www.anthonybyrne.ie/tenantapplicationform ONLY**********\n\n** Please note applicants or enquiries for properties advertised TO LET will NOT be accepted over the phone. Prospective tenants can only apply for properties TO LET by completing a tenant application form on our website link below. Applications that are not made through our website will not be processed. **\n\nAnthony Byrne Property Services are delighted to present this bright and well-proportioned studio apartment, ideally located on Fair Street in the heart of Drogheda.\n\nThe property benefits from high ceilings and plenty of natural light, creating a bright and welcoming living space. The studio offers a practical layout, making excellent use of the available space.\n\nThe apartment also benefits from a large shared utility room, which is shared with just one other studio apartment.\n\nProperty Features:\n\nBright and spacious studio apartment\nHigh ceilings\nExcellent town-centre location\nElectric heating\nElectricity included in the rent\nBins included in the rent\nShared utility room with one other studio apartment\nNo parking available\nNo pets permitted\n\nIdeally situated within walking distance of Drogheda town centre, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities close by.\n\n*********Please make an application at https://www.anthonybyrne.ie/tenantapplicationform ONLY**********\n\n** Please note applicants or enquiries for properties advertised TO LET will NOT be accepted over the phone. Prospective tenants can only apply for properties TO LET by completing a tenant application form on our website link below. Applications that are not made through our website will not be processed. **",
